@startuml KafkaProducerSimplified
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor lightgreen
    BorderColor darkgreen
    ArrowColor darkgreen
}

title Simplified Kafka Producer State Machine

[*] --> Initialized

Initialized --> Serializing : send() called

Serializing --> Partitioning : key/value serialized
note right of Serializing
    Convert key and value 
    objects to byte arrays
end note

Partitioning --> Accumulating : partition determined
note right of Partitioning
    DefaultPartitioner uses key hash
    or round-robin if key is null
end note

Accumulating --> Batching : record added to buffer
note right of Accumulating
    RecordAccumulator buffers
    records per partition
end note

Batching --> Sending : batch ready (size/time threshold)
note right of Batching
    Configurable batch.size
    and linger.ms parameters
end note

state Sending {
    [*] --> NetworkSend
    NetworkSend --> Acknowledged : success
    NetworkSend --> RetryableError : retriable failure
    NetworkSend --> NonRetryableError : permanent failure
    
    RetryableError --> BackoffWait : retries available
    RetryableError --> Failed : max retries exceeded
    BackoffWait --> NetworkSend : backoff complete
}

Acknowledged --> Success
NonRetryableError --> Failed
Failed --> [*] : callback notified
Success --> Initialized : ready for next message

Initialized --> Closing : close() called

state Closing {
    [*] --> FlushPending
    FlushPending --> StopSender
    StopSender --> CloseConnections  
    CloseConnections --> [*]
}

note bottom
    Key Features:
    • Asynchronous processing with callbacks
    • Configurable batching and compression
    • Automatic retries with exponential backoff
    • Memory-bounded buffering
    • Thread-safe operation
end note

@enduml